@ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress = http://localhost:5178

### Get Fleet
GET {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/fleet
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Companies
GET {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/companies
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Company By ID
GET {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/companies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Company
POST {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalName": "Transportes Escolares del Perú S.A.C.",
  "commercialName": "TransEscolar S.A.C.",
  "ruc": "20601234567",
  "status": "active",
  "plan": "Enterprise Fleet",
  "planLimitVehicles": 30,
  "planLimitStudents": 1800,
  "adminName": "Carlos Mendoza",
  "adminEmail": "cmendoza@transescolar.pe",
  "phone": "+51 987 654 321",
  "address": "Av. Javier Prado Este 2450, San Borja, Lima",
  "operatingDistricts": ["San Borja", "Surco", "La Molina", "Miraflores", "San Isidro"],
  "verified": true,
  "licenseExpiration": "2028-11-05T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### Get Company Management Dashboard (Frontend View)
GET {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/companyManagement
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Compliance Item Status
PATCH {{ChildrenPath.Platform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/companyManagement/compliance/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###
